[{"id":177953530,"discussion_id":"3bde5a1dd834b11ff6d677dd3bfda05e8604323c","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-nn/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| common | ✅ [*苏跃明*](https://gitcode.com/su-yueming), [*王星*](https://gitcode.com/wang-xing001) (2/2) | ✅ [*苏跃明*](https://gitcode.com/su-yueming), [*王星*](https://gitcode.com/wang-xing001) (2/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n\n------\n\n## CLA Signature Pass  \n sunhao_hw, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-07-01T09:29:46+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-01T16:28:49+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177954098,"discussion_id":"9ffa439141b6a1dc2b0a649f16e99eb2d1994fef","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n该PR为ONNX BatchNorm插件适配opset 14，主要针对ONNX BatchNormalization算子从opset 14开始新增的 `training_mode` 属性进行透传。核心改动是在 `batch_normalization_onnx_plugin.cpp` 中将原有的单一算子注册拆分为两个：opset 8–13 仍使用原 `ParseParamsBatchNorm` 解析函数，opset 14–18 则使用新增的 `ParseParamsBatchNormV14` 函数，后者解析 `training_mode` 整数属性并转换为 `is_training` 布尔值传递给下游算子。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **新增 `ParseParamsBatchNormV14` 函数**：针对opset 14+的BatchNormalization算子，新增解析 `training_mode`（INT类型）属性的逻辑，并将其转换为 `is_training` 布尔属性（`training_mode == 1` 时为 `true`），取代原先固定为 `false` 的 `is_training` 设置。\n- **拆分 `REGISTER_CUSTOM_OP` 注册**：将原来覆盖opset 8–18的单一注册拆分为两个独立注册，opset 8–13 绑定 `ParseParamsBatchNorm`，opset 14–18 绑定 `ParseParamsBatchNormV14`，实现按opset版本分流处理。\n- **简化 `OriginOpType` 语法**：将原先 `ge::AscendString(...)` 包装的算子类型字符串统一改为直接使用字符串字面量。\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-01T09:32:05+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-01T09:32:05+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177956295,"discussion_id":"cdaa7056f1e657f8b1caa85ce9d99d69a8bfed92","body":"#### 代码审查\n\n✅ 未发现问题\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-01T09:40:37+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-01T09:40:37+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177957749,"discussion_id":"aa5c669fc12c4aca1dda671ed2a915ba45611c8e","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-07-01T09:46:09+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-01T09:46:09+08:00","user":{"id":"688476a6dea8931fab64405e","login":"sunhao_hw","object_id":"688476a6dea8931fab64405e","name":"sunhao_hw","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/sunhao_hw"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177958322,"discussion_id":"380625f55ec7abe59f0f4ff112f94fca36210277","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www